    <item>
      <title>Presented poster @ AI Day 2026, IITGn</title>
      <link>http://localhost:61763/people/subhrajit/updates/ai-day/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 12 Feb 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://localhost:61763/people/subhrajit/updates/ai-day/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;I attended the AI Day 2026 at IIT Gandhinagar on 12th February 2026, where I had presented a poster for our work &amp;ldquo;Davids vs. Goliath &amp;mdash; Achieving GPU-like performance using Network of Stations&amp;rdquo;. It was a great experience to interact with the attendees and share our work on achieving GPU-like performance using a network of stations. Below are some photos from the event.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;relative inline-block align-text-bottom icon&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 640 512&#34;&gt;&lt;path fill=&#34;currentColor&#34; d=&#34;M172.5 131.1C228.1 75.51 320.5 75.51 376.1 131.1C426.1 181.1 433.5 260.8 392.4 318.3L391.3 319.9C381 334.2 361 337.6 346.7 327.3C332.3 317 328.9 297 339.2 282.7L340.3 281.1C363.2 249 359.6 205.1 331.7 177.2C300.3 145.8 249.2 145.8 217.7 177.2L105.5 289.5C73.99 320.1 73.99 372 105.5 403.5C133.3 431.4 177.3 435 209.3 412.1L210.9 410.1C225.3 400.7 245.3 404 255.5 418.4C265.8 432.8 262.5 452.8 248.1 463.1L246.5 464.2C188.1 505.3 110.2 498.7 60.21 448.8C3.741 392.3 3.741 300.7 60.21 244.3L172.5 131.1zM467.5 380C411 436.5 319.5 436.5 263 380C213 330 206.5 251.2 247.6 193.7L248.7 192.1C258.1 177.8 278.1 174.4 293.3 184.7C307.7 194.1 311.1 214.1 300.8 229.3L299.7 230.9C276.8 262.1 280.4 306.9 308.3 334.8C339.7 366.2 390.8 366.2 422.3 334.8L534.5 222.5C566 191 566 139.1 534.5 108.5C506.7 80.63 462.7 76.99 430.7 99.9L429.1 101C414.7 111.3 394.7 107.1 384.5 93.58C374.2 79.2 377.5 59.21 391.9 48.94L393.5 47.82C451 6.731 529.8 13.25 579.8 63.24C636.3 119.7 636.3 211.3 579.8 267.7L467.5 380z&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:61763/people/subhrajit/gallery/misc/&#34; &gt;Gallery&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
